'''Tomoaki Imakuni''' (Japanese: '''今国智章''' ''Imakuni Tomoaki''), usually referred to as '''Imakuni?''' ('''イマクニ？''' ''Imakuni?''), is a staff member at [[Creatures, Inc.]] involved in various aspects of the {{Trading Card Game}}, including illustrations and other appearances on several cards.<ref>[https://www.pokemon.com/us/strategy/a-fresh-look-at-the-old-pokemon-tcg-style A Fresh Look at the Old Pokémon TCG Style, pokemon.com]</ref> Imakuni is known as an eccentric musician who performed some of the music for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

Imakuni? played a small part in the designing of {{vg|Pokémon Ranger}} and [[Pokémon Ranger: Shadows of Almia|its sequel, Shadows of Almia]]. He is in the band [[Suzukisan]]. He is also credited as the author of the [[Pokémon Tales]] picture book "[[PB02|Come Out, Squirtle!]]".

Additionally, Imakuni? starred in his own card game titled ''Bakaboom : Composition Game So Hard Your Brain Will Spill Out''.<ref name="Every Game Ever ep62">[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r2LmD8HBwto Every Game Ever Ep. 62 - The Legend of Imakuni? & The Bakaboom Card Game]</ref>

