===Pokémon Trading Card Game===
Imakuni? appears as a special hidden opponent in {{vg|Pokémon Trading Card Game}}. He is named "Strange Life-Form Imakuni?" in this game. His event is activated by talking to a lass in the [[Water Club]] where he will begin to randomly appear in the lounge rooms of [[Fighting Club|Fighting]], [[Lightning Club|Lightning]], [[Science Club|Science]] and [[Water Club|Water]] Clubs, each time the save file is opened. When in the room, unusual music will play and when the player talks to him, he will sing music from {{aniseries|OS}} then entice the player to dance. He will finally challenge the player to a card game, in which he uses the {{TCG|Imakuni? Deck}}. 

When Imakuni? is defeated, he will reward the player with four booster packs, one from each expansion set. After being defeated three and six times, he will instead give the player the {{OBP|Imakuni?|CoroCoro promo}} Trainer card.

