===eReader Functionality===
The promo card {{TCG ID|P Promo|Shining Imakuni?|18}} contains two data strips that could be scanned in to a Nintendo [[e-Reader]]. The short data strip has detailed information about the promo card and reveals 10 of Imakuni?'s biggest secrets.

====Imakuni?'s 10 big secrets====
*1: I have a pocket in my stomach! Besides, it’s a bit unkempt!
*2: I always seem to carry an Imakuni? Fan Club notebook. But still, no one will write in it.
*3: I have four stomachs, like a cow.
*5: Four is an ominous number, so I stopped using it.
*6: As a child, I was looked after by my grandpa in the south of South America.
*7: I often go to a 100 Yen shop.
*8: If you say "''{{tt|chitchee|Slang for small}}''", I will regrettably reply "''{{tt|deke|Slang for large}} yo!''".
*9: Nothing in particular.
*10: My first love was in the spring of 9th grade.
*10 Part 2: I confessed by telephone after graduating from junior high school, but was turned down.<ref name="Every Game Ever ep62"/>

====Imakuni?'s Ball Mini-game====
The long data strip contains the mini-game [[Imakuni?'s Ball]].<ref name="Every Game Ever ep62"/>

